  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Duvar-Exclusive reporting on human rights violations in Turkey</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to come up with exclusive articles that focus on human rights abuses in today&#x2019;s Turkey ranging from minorities to women, to children, journalists et al. Duvar English would like to contribute to the country&#x2019;s objective reporting scene which is very weak at the moment due to heavy government monitoring and pressure over the mainstream media landscape.</narrative>
  </description>
